# Loopin Web

A modern web application built with [Next.js](https://nextjs.org), bootstrapped using [`create-next-app`](https://nextjs.org/docs/app/api-reference/cli/create-next-app).

## Tech Stack

- Next.js
- React
- TypeScript
- App Router
- Geist Font

---

## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

Make sure you have one of the following installed:

- Node.js (recommended)
- npm / yarn / pnpm / bun

### Installation

Clone the repository and install dependencies:

```bash
git clone <repository-url>
cd <project-name>
npm install
```

### Run Development Server

```bash
npm run dev
```

Alternatively:

```bash
yarn dev
pnpm dev
bun dev
```

Open your browser and navigate to:

```text
http://localhost:3000
```

The application will automatically reload when you make changes.

---

## Project Structure

```text
app/
├── page.tsx        # Main page
├── layout.tsx      # Root layout
├── globals.css     # Global styles
```

You can start editing the application by modifying:

```text
app/page.tsx
```

---

## Fonts

This project uses the built-in Next.js font optimization system via:

- Geist Sans
- Geist Mono

Fonts are loaded automatically using `next/font`.

---

## Available Scripts

```bash
npm run dev      # Start development server
npm run build    # Create production build
npm run start    # Start production server
npm run lint     # Run ESLint
```

